stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Unavailable
  %% event attach
  Unavailable --> Gui: Attach editor
  %% event acquire
  Gui --> Mcp: Acquire at revision
  %% event conflict
  Gui --> Gui: Busy or conflict
  %% event edit-renew
  Mcp --> Mcp: Renew or edit
  %% event end-lease
  Mcp --> Releasing: Release, expiry, detach or revocation
