  Releasing --> Unavailable: Editor detached
  %% event native-fault
  Mcp --> Faulted: Native commit fault
  %% event drain-fault
  Releasing --> Faulted: Drain fault
  %% event protect
  Faulted --> Faulted: Writes blocked
